# @repo/ui - Vanilla shadcn/ui Primitives

**Philosophy:** Vanilla shadcn/ui with minimal customization.

## Key Principles

- Use shadcn defaults - they're already good
- No custom design tokens - just shadcn
- Loading states: `<Loader2 className="animate-spin" />` from lucide-react
- When in doubt, copy from shadcn docs

## Import Convention

```typescript
// Consumers import from package root
import { Button, Card, Input } from "@repo/ui"

// NOT deep paths
import { Button } from "@repo/ui/src/primitives/button" // WRONG
```

## Loading States

shadcn Button does NOT have a `loading` prop:

```tsx
import { Loader2 } from "lucide-react"

<Button disabled={isLoading}>
  {isLoading && <Loader2 className="size-4 animate-spin" />}
  Submit
</Button>
```

## Badge Variants

For semantic colors (success, warning):

```tsx
// Success
<Badge variant="outline" className="border-green-500/50 bg-green-500/10 text-green-600">
  Success
</Badge>

// Warning
<Badge variant="outline" className="border-amber-500/50 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-600">
  Warning
</Badge>
```

## Toasts

```tsx
import { toast } from "sonner"

toast.success("Saved!")
toast.error("Something went wrong")
```

## Semantic Colors

```typescript
// CORRECT
"bg-primary text-primary-foreground"
"bg-card border-border"
"text-muted-foreground"

// WRONG
"bg-blue-500 text-white"
"bg-zinc-800"
```

## Adding Components

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add [component-name]
```
